        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"21\") (name \"/NET0029\") (class \"Default\")\n      (node (ref \"J1\") (pin \"21\") (pinfunction \"Pin_21\") (pintype \"passive\"))\n      (node (ref \"J8\") (pin \"21\") (pinfunction \"Pin_21\") (pintype \"passive\"))\n      (node (ref \"R23\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "R5 /NET0003 /NET0038 0"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "R14 /NET0003 /NET0033 0"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "R21 /NET0031 Net-_J6-Pin_3_ 0"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "R8 Net-_J6-Pin_3_ Net-_J11-Pin_3_ 0"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "This creates a hybrid PWM/serial connection not supported by the intended design. It shorts two alternative M5Stack GPIO pins together for each channel, causing GPIO contention, possible damage, and loss of independent PWM control; it also loads the MAX3485 serial bus through the 1 kΩ PWM resistors, potentially corrupting serial servo communication.",
